git commit -m "docs: design category and enrolment management endpoints

Added category and enrolment endpoint specifications:

Categories (Public + Organiser):
- GET /api/events/{eventId}/categories - Public list
- POST /api/events/{eventId}/categories - Organiser add
- PUT /api/categories/{id} - Organiser update
- DELETE /api/categories/{id} - Organiser delete

Enrolments (Participant + Organiser):
- POST /api/categories/{categoryId}/enrolments - Participant enrol
- GET /api/enrolments/me - Participant view own enrolments
- GET /api/events/{eventId}/enrolments - Organiser view all

Key validation:
- 409 Conflict when already enrolled
- 400 Bad Request when category full
- 403 Forbidden when not event owner

This continues the API endpoint plan for Section B.

This is commit #10 of 20."
